<title>USA: Nationwide Health files $300 mn debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Nationwide Health files $300 mn debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nationwide Health Properties Inc filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $300 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The Newport Beach, Calif., real estate investment trust said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes including debt repayment.</p>
<p>Underwriters for the offering are Goldman Sachs &amp; Co and Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
</text>
